{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16201060","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1620106001:2":{"text":"ずいぶん騒ぎ立ててくれたじゃない。毎晩、棺桶の上を跳ね回って。","source_cn":"在墓园里作乱的时候不是胆子大得很吗？整夜整夜在棺材上跳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63C7F48B44EC8BC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620106002:1":{"text":"それがいざ霊を目の前にすると、急に怖くなったのかしら？","source_cn":"怎么，现在被抓了，知道害怕了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E496F5252FA92B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620106003:1":{"text":"言いなさい！どうしてこれまでずっと、私の安眠を邪魔していたの？","source_cn":"说！为什么一直要在墓地捣乱，打扰我的安眠？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757A753BEB891319","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620106004:2":{"text":"スヴァルフさんが……","source_cn":"魔法师先生，你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8FDFB98D3DB5799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620106005:1":{"text":"ど……どうしてそんなことができるんですか？ロンロンは失望しました！","source_cn":"你……你怎么能做这种事呢？满满对你很失望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EB62F5DB68F925A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_ti